This folder contains two case studies:
    - Casino
    - RemoveOne

Make sure the env var KEY evaluates to the path of the current project.
To setup the variable in the current terminal session run (in the current folder)
    "source setup_env"

This will create env_var with the KEY variable and save its value in the current terminal session.

Refer to the README in the corresponding folders.

The first run of KeY4CATs IS EXPECTED to show a warning because the main folder .key4cats does not exists.
